{"id":"n85176-1-7","stage":3,"title":"높이다 · 增高","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85176-1-7-1","ko":"신발이 낮아서 키가 작아 보이지 않아?","zh":"鞋跟低，看起来会显矮吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"신발이","meaning":"鞋","explanation":"신발：鞋；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"신발","audio":"/audio/514d3c6f08937125aef8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30213","senseId":"1","lemma":"신발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신발이","audio":"/audio/784ef2995d1c49548934.mp3"}},{"text":"낮아서","meaning":"低","explanation":"낮다：低；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"낮다","audio":"/audio/066edc9ea6d8d3424666.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58155","senseId":"2","lemma":"낮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낮아서","audio":"/audio/fdcb690065aafa7fb8b5.mp3"}},{"text":"키가","meaning":"身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿","explanation":"키：身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"키","audio":"/audio/e37db65fd90db469af33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20269","senseId":"1","lemma":"키","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"키가","audio":"/audio/26f2f72df3c979a9df96.mp3"}},{"text":"작아","meaning":"小， 矮","explanation":"작다：小， 矮；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"작다","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69513","senseId":"1","lemma":"작다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"작아","audio":"/audio/b09849b648864af6ae59.mp3"}},{"text":"보이지","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이지","audio":"/audio/188cdbba9fe03ad1c5b3.mp3"}},{"text":"않아?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sourc