nation":"굽：鞋跟；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"굽","audio":"/audio/8fcba4c6011cc9271389.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36203","senseId":"2","lemma":"굽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"굽을","audio":"/audio/3b673765d0da01ec0e38.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"높이는","meaning":"增高，加高","explanation":"높이다：增高，加高；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"높이다","audio":"/audio/fac4c065ee34b08ee459.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85176","senseId":"1","lemma":"높이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"높이는","audio":"/audio/8d28f26f424a6deb6f28.mp3"}},{"text":"건","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건","audio":"/audio/f5fd44f22ad30ad631dc.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7ca52d3e5ceed208","term":"글쎄","zh":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3","entryId":"29723","definition":"对于对方所提出的问题或要求，表现出不确定的态度。","pronunciation":["글쎄"]},{"id":"25763f89d255f125","term":"그러면","zh":"那么","audio":"/audio/25763f89d255f1256055.mp3","entryId":"58276","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그러면"]},{"id":"8fcba4c6011cc927","term":"굽","zh":"鞋跟","audio":"/audio/8fcba4c6011cc9271389.mp3","entryId":"36203","definition":"脚底的脚后跟部分。","pronunciation":["굽"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"fac4c065ee34b08e","term":"높이다","zh":"增高，加高","audio":"/audio/fac4c065ee34b08ee459.mp3","entryId":"85176","definition":"使上下距离变长。","pronunciation":["노피다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/31de7482e7d8606b47d4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.117,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=85176","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":109,"sequenceScore":2.8423,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["鞋跟低，看起来会显矮吧？","嗯，那换成鞋跟高一点的怎么样？","承奎的英语真好啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["鞋子鞋跟不高，所以看起来不会显得个子矮吧？","嗯，那换成鞋跟高一点的怎么样？","承奎的英语真好啊。"],"answer":1}]}
